 "selection_method": "Installed AutomationBench manifests (Luna top-20 per non-simple category plus earlier installed manifests) replayed on their recorded GPT Luna development episodes. Accepted when Luna fully passed the task or scored at least 0.5, and the manifest binds the 16-turn training task, scores without assessment or credit errors, has decided required goals, and, on a Luna full pass, passes every required goal with no harm finding. Record-update manifests without goal findings are excluded because step credit reads goal and harm findings. Evaluation: two tasks per domain preferring different difficulty tiers, then a tier-balanced fill to 20 without further simple tasks (seed 20261005). Difficulty tier: earlier LFM2.5-2.6B SAMPO group mean reward when available (easy >= 0.6, medium >= 0.2, hard otherwise), else Luna outcome and goal count. v2 adds Simple training tasks up to 20: every Simple draft or installed manifest replayed on its Luna episode with the training step-credit reader (record goals count; drafts bound to the user message when the whole-prompt binding was the only mismatch), accepted by the same rule, ranked by Luna score with ties broken by sha256(\"20261006:\" + task name). Evaluation is v1's.",
